structurecompasslegacy.limitation.aether_bronze=Bronze dungeons require the Aether decoration sequence and underground space checks; the adapter is not implemented yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.atum_ruin=Ruins exclude nearby pyramid layouts; local generation order is not adapted yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.decoration_random=This decoration-stage structure still needs an adapter for random state and prerequisite terrain.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.spawn_order=The starting structure depends on spawn selection and dimension initialization, which are not adapted yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.twilight_hollow_tree=Hollow trees use a separate generator; layout and terrain validation are not connected yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.dimensional_fracture=Fractures connect dimensions and schedule delayed generation; their state is not isolated yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.aurorian_unseeded_random=Generation uses randomness independent of the world seed. Actual coordinates cannot be reproduced; inaccurate simulation support has been removed.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.reference_height=Horizontal coordinates follow generation rules. Y is a navigation reference; the actual entrance height depends on terrain.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.abyssal_darklands=Selection and chance checks are interleaved with ground checks and other ruins. Terrain and random consumption have not been reproduced reliably.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.abyssal_decoration=Generation depends on preceding lakes, strongholds and a shared decoration random source. An isolated, reliable replay is not yet available.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.abyssal_shoggoth=Each dimension uses a different entry point, with preceding ore, lake or ruin random consumption and cross-chunk ground checks. Not yet adapted.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.omothol_spacing=Placement excludes nearby buildings using an in-memory position set, and random state depends on chunk generation order. Coordinates cannot be reproduced reliably without reading those records.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.binding_failed=Could not bind compatibility for this mod version. See the compatibility loading error in the log.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.lamented_islands_anchor=Navigates to the starting island template origin at Y=90. The mod generates the island layout. In-game validation is pending.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.lamented_islands_spacing=Lamented Islands spacing must exceed 16; the current value gives the mod an invalid natural-generation random bound.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.endexpansion_counter=Placement depends on a generator call counter and chunk generation order. The seed alone cannot reproduce coordinates; unsupported in this release.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.endexpansion_fortress=Grid candidates are known, but layout uses global randomness and success depends on component count. Full success validation is not adapted yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.endexpansion_stronghold=Replaces the vanilla stronghold generator. Independent start and layout validation are not adapted yet.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.raids_village_state=Placement queries the nearest unexplored village and depends on live exploration and structure state. This release does not read those records and cannot reliably locate it.
structurecompasslegacy.reason.recursive_chunk=Generation requested the same unfinished chunk recursively. Simulation stopped.
structurecompasslegacy.reason.unknown_structure=The server has no matching structure entry. Reopen the compass.
structurecompasslegacy.show_unsupported=Show unsupported
structurecompasslegacy.no_matches=No matching structures.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.divinerpg_template=Predicts the first template component, height and rotation. Skips candidates sharing population areas with other large structures on the same layer; closer structures may be omitted. Awaiting in-game validation.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.divinerpg_hut=The natural probability is reproducible; biome, grass and foundation checks still need an adapter.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.divinerpg_decoration=House selection follows dungeon placement and depends on its random consumption and ground checks. Replay is not implemented.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.divinerpg_hunger_house=Candidate positions are calculable; template selection, rotation offsets and overlap with other buildings still need adaptation.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.journey_village_reload=This version builds village starts only when reloading chunks, not when generating new chunks. Actual placement depends on loading order; grid prediction alone is insufficient.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.journey_decoration=Structure selection shares randomness with earlier decoration and requires ground or space checks. The necessary replay is not implemented.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_island_anchor=Predicts the natural island center; Y is its generation height and may be inside the island or pond. In-game validation pending.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_root_anchor=Locates the root base at Y=114, usually underwater. Returns the first naturally generated arch for each candidate chunk. In-game validation pending.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_spirit_tree=Pending: clearing biomes only narrow the area. Decoration order, shuffled candidates, space checks and neighbouring generation still need replaying.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_sludge_dungeon=Pending: replay clearing candidates and natural generation order; isolate region overlap checks, shared loot and entity state.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_decoration_storage=Pending: replay preceding decoration randomness, terrain and natural placement checks; isolate Betweenlands region storage.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_shack=Pending: the three layouts share decoration randomness. Replay layout selection, terrain and placement checks; isolate region storage.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_waystone=Pending: grid candidates are predictable, but placement requires the decorated ground, fluid and space checks.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_druid_circle=Pending: generates in the Overworld. Suitable swamp ground is found before rolling the natural chance; loaded-area and space checks also need replaying.
structurecompasslegacy.limitation.betweenlands_simulacrum=Pending: replay preceding decoration randomness, ground and space checks; isolate simulacrum block entity state.
structurecompasslegacy.reason.betweenlands_biome_layers=The current Betweenlands biome layers differ from the supported rules; reliable prediction is unavailable.
